<SCENARIO VER="105">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nリファレンス表題\r\n11\r\n255\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "456" "リファレンス詳細テキスト" "11" "255" "1000" "NORMAL" "WAIT"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\超炭酸ボンバー川.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MOTION "789" "リファレンスボード" "3" "-900" "500" "INC" "WAIT"}
{DELETECG "リファレンス表題,リファレンスボード,リファレンス表題テキスト" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\カウボーイ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\超炭酸ボイス\0_hey.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<TXSPN>―Hey, you bastards! The day has finally come when a human flies through the sky on a convenience-store drink!
{PAUSE ""}
　
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\超炭酸.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\超炭酸ボイス\1_there.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
What I've got here is Super Soda Bomber, which just went on sale in Japan the other day!
{PAUSE ""}
　
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\超炭酸ボイス\2_just.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<BR>
The bottle can alone weighs a whole 1 kilogram―amazing stuff!<PG>
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\超炭酸ボイス\3_well.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Okay, first let's test how far one bottle flies!
{PAUSE ""}
　
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\超炭酸ボイス\4_the.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
The method is the same as a bottle rocket! Except we don't pump in any air, we just shake the bottle.
{PAUSE ""}
　
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\超炭酸ボイス\5.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Set it on the bottle-rocket stand, press this switch, and the cap opens automatically.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MOTION "789" "000" "4" "-290" "5000" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
